{"c":"453025","n":"JIZERA 13","t":"P","s":"VČ","o":"Jilemnice","url":"453025-jizera-13","stav":"2026-10-04","popis":"Od jezu přádelny v Poniklé až k soutoku s Havírenským potokem. Přítoky jsou chráněná rybí oblast – lov ryb zakázán. Na revíru jsou vyznačena trdliště lipana podhorního. V těchto úsecích je zakázáno brodění v období od\r\n16. 4. do 31. 5.:\r\n– od jezu MVE – k. ú. Poniklá nad Jizerou (Seba) (GPS: 50°39'16.553\"N, 15°26'52.994\"E) až po jez MVE – k. ú. Poniklá nad Jizerou (Přeložka) (GPS: 50°40'1.072\"N, 15°27'13.010\"E), – od ústí Farského p. – k. ú. Hradsko (Nístějka) (GPS: 50°40'27.095\"N, 15°26'58.298\"E) až po jez MVE Hradsko (GPS: 50°40'47.048\"N,\r\n15°27'5.244\"E),\r\n– od ústí Tříčského p. – Hradsko (GPS: 50°41'3.252\"N, 15°27'4.197\"E) až po jez MVE Jablonec nad Jizerou (GPS: 50°42'11.362\"N, 15°25'29.305\"E).","delka":9,"rozloha":10,"lat":50.695325,"lon":15.435903,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/jilemnice","mo_tel":"603541316","mo_mail":"leoszalabsky@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":70,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":nu